# C++ Implementation of Enterprise Data Analysis System

I'll convert the Python code to C++ while maintaining the same functionality. Note that C++ is a statically typed language with different paradigms, so the implementation will need to use classes, templates, and other C++ features to achieve similar functionality.

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <fstream>
#include <vector>
#include <string>
#include <unordered_map>
#include <thread>
#include <mutex>
#include <condition_variable>
